                    "status": "current"
                },
                {
                    "id": "critical_question",
                    "topic": "limitations",
                    "basis": "interpretation",
                    "text": "buildCommitArgs明确--no-verify，merge也跳过验证，可能绕过团队期待的提交钩子；这与终端默认提交不等价。runGit没有通用超时且stderr累计不设同等上限，远端卡住与异常输出需验；argv隔离不等于Git hooks/凭据副作用被隔离。",
                    "evidence_ids": [
                        "2026-10-21-06-github-1340492447-root-source"
                    ],
                    "dependencies": [
                        {
                            "plugin_id": "github:1340492447:root",
